From 04ee400cabc99cf55c8008af23e0a5a8d10356fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Pivotto <291750+roidelapluie@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 15:57:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] tsdb: stabilize the XOR2 float chunk encoding

Deprecate the --enable-feature=xor2-encoding flag. It now only sets
the default for storage.tsdb.chunk_encoding.floats and will become a
no-op in a future major version; select xor2 directly in the config
instead.

Signed-off-by: Julien Pivotto <291750+roidelapluie@users.noreply.github.com>
